### Bookkeeping API — REST Client Test Collection
### Use: IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client (Ultimate) or VS Code REST Client extension
###
### Quick Start:
###   1. Run the "Login" request first
###   2. All subsequent requests use the token automatically
###
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080
### Test Account: demo / demo123

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = {{login.response.body.result.token}}


# ============================================================
# 0. Setup & Health
# ============================================================

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### Login (get token)
### @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "demo123"
}


# ============================================================
# 1. Authentication
# ============================================================

### Get Current User
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update User Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nickname": "Demo User",
  "email": "demo@bookkeeping.com"
}


# ============================================================
# 2. Accounts
# ============================================================

### List All Accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Account by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Savings Account",
  "accountType": "SAVINGS",
  "currency": "USD",
  "initialBalance": 1000000,
  "description": "Monthly savings"
}

### Update Account
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Main Checking",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### Delete Account (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# ============================================================
# 3. Categories
# ============================================================

### List All Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Category
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Subscriptions",
  "categoryType": "EXPENSE"
}


# ============================================================
# 4. Transactions (CRUD + Search + Month Nav)
# ============================================================

### List Transactions (default 100)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Transactions by Month (current month)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions?year=2026&month=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Transactions with Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions?year=2026&month=5&transactionType=3&accountId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search Transactions (text search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions?search=salary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Statistics for a Month
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/statistics?year=2026&month=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Income Transaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "transactionType": 2,
  "accountId": 1,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "amount": 500000,
  "description": "Monthly bonus",
  "transactionTime": {{$datetime iso8601}}
}

### Create Expense Transaction (with date)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "transactionType": 3,
  "accountId": 1,
  "categoryId": 5,
  "amount": 3500,
  "description": "Lunch meeting",
  "transactionTime": 1779369600
}

### Create Transfer Transaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "transactionType": 4,
  "accountId": 1,
  "destinationAccountId": 2,
  "amount": 100000,
  "description": "Transfer to savings",
  "transactionTime": 1779369600
}

### Create Transaction with Tags
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "transactionType": 3,
  "accountId": 1,
  "categoryId": 7,
  "amount": 8900,
  "description": "Online shopping",
  "transactionTime": 1779369600,
  "tagIds": "1,2"
}

### Update Transaction
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/15
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "transactionType": 3,
  "accountId": 1,
  "categoryId": 5,
  "amount": 5000,
  "description": "Updated lunch meeting",
  "transactionTime": 1779369600
}

### Update Transaction Tags
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/15
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "transactionType": 3,
  "accountId": 1,
  "categoryId": 5,
  "amount": 5000,
  "description": "Updated lunch meeting",
  "transactionTime": 1779369600,
  "tagIds": "1"
}

### Delete Transaction
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# ============================================================
# 5. Tags (CRUD)
# ============================================================

### List All Tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Tag
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Business",
  "color": "#2196F3"
}

### Create Another Tag
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tags
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Personal",
  "color": "#E91E63"
}

### Update Tag
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tags/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Work",
  "color": "#FF5722"
}

### Delete Tag
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tags/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# ============================================================
# 6. Statistics & Charts
# ============================================================

### Get Monthly Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/statistics?year=2026&month=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Previous Month Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/statistics?year=2026&month=4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# ============================================================
# 7. Budgets (CRUD)
# ============================================================

### List Budgets for Month
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/budgets?year=2026&month=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Budget
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/budgets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "categoryId": 5,
  "amount": 50000,
  "year": 2026,
  "month": 5
}

### Create Budget for Shopping
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/budgets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "categoryId": 7,
  "amount": 20000,
  "year": 2026,
  "month": 5
}

### Update Budget
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/budgets/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": 60000
}

### Delete Budget
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/budgets/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# ============================================================
# 8. CSV Export
# ============================================================

### Export Transactions as CSV (current month)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/export?year=2026&month=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Export All Transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/export
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Export Transactions by Account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/export?accountId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# ============================================================
# 9. Swagger / OpenAPI
# ============================================================

### OpenAPI JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/api-docs

### Swagger UI
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui/index.html


# ============================================================
# 10. Complete Smoke Test
# Run these in order for full integration test
# ============================================================

### [Smoke] 1. Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### [Smoke] 2. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "demo123"
}

### [Smoke] 3. Get User
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### [Smoke] 4. List Accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### [Smoke] 5. Create Transaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "transactionType": 2,
  "accountId": 1,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "amount": 100000,
  "description": "Smoke test income",
  "transactionTime": {{$datetime iso8601}}
}

### [Smoke] 6. Get Transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### [Smoke] 7. Get Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/statistics?year=2026&month=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### [Smoke] 8. Get Tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### [Smoke] 9. Get Budgets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/budgets?year=2026&month=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### [Smoke] 10. Export CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/export?year=2026&month=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### [Smoke] 11. Final Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health